#: openexpress/updates.py:43
msgid ""
"\n"
"To finish the installation:\n"
"  1. Disconnect the device from the computer.\n"
"  2. If the device does not turn on by itself, turn it on.\n"
"  3. The device installs the update by itself. It may ask whether to install "
"it:\n"
"     choose to install now. It may also restart. Wait until it has "
"finished.\n"
"  4. Reconnect it and run `openexpress updates`: the installed update\n"
"     should no longer be listed.\n"
msgstr ""

#: openexpress/updates.py:53
msgid ""
"\n"
"To finish the installation:\n"
"  1. Disconnect the device from the computer.\n"
"  2. If the device does not turn on by itself, turn it on.\n"
"  3. The device installs the update by itself. It may ask whether to install "
"it:\n"
"     choose to install now. It may also restart. Wait until it has "
"finished.\n"
"  4. Reconnect it and check for updates again: the installed update\n"
"     should no longer be listed.\n"
msgstr ""

